OL,3,GNEWSAOlder patients get quicker autism
OL,4,Aassessments
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver-65s receiving treatment from
OL,7,Fmental health teams will be able to
OL,8,Faccess faster autism assessments
OL,9,Ffollowing a successful pilot.
OL,11,FEasington NHS mental health service had
OL,12,Fbeen one of the first nationally to
OL,13,Fpilot the scheme and in the first year
OL,14,Fit reduced average waiting times for
OL,15,Folder people accessing secondary mental
OL,16,Fhealth care from 118 weeks to 20.
OL,18,FFollowing the pilot diagnosing autism
OL,19,Fwithin the service, the scheme will now
OL,20,Fbe rolled out across County Durham and
OL,21,FTeesside.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
