OL,3,GNEWSAOlder patients get quicker autism
OL,4,Aassessments
OL,5,
OL,6,FClinical psychologist for Tees, Esk and
OL,7,FWear Valleys NHS Foundation Trust
OL,8,F(TEWV), Dr Jonathan Summerill, said
OL,9,Folder people who are autistic often
OL,10,Fwent undiagnosed, but a diagnosis could
OL,11,Fchange the care they receive.
